s shall be employed in that spiritual body, I do not say what I see, but I say what I believe, according to that which I read in the psalm, \"I believed, therefore have I spoken.\"    I say, then, they shall in the body see God; but whether they"],[46013011,1,["Augustine"],["Augustine: The City of God"],"And so, when I am asked how the saints shall be employed in that spiritual body, I do not say what I see, but I say what I believe, according to that which I read in the psalm, \"I believed, therefore have I spoken.\"    I say, then, they shall in the body see God; but whether they"]],"f":[["Athanasius",1,["Life of Antony"],"34. Wherefore there is no need to set much value on these things, nor for the sake of them to practise a life of discipline and labour; but that living well we may please God. And we neither ought to pray to know the future, nor to ask for it as the reward of our discipline; but"],["Augustine",1,["The City of God"],"And so, when I am asked how the saints shall be employed in that spiritual body, I do not say what I see, but I say what I believe, according to that which I read in the psalm, \"I believed, therefore have I spoken.\"    I say, then, they shall in the body see God; but whether they"],["Chrysostom",1,["Homilies on First and Second Corinthians"],"Mark his energy. He suffers them not even to wait for his presence, nor to receive him first and then pass the sentence of binding: but as if on the point of expelling some contagion before that it have spread itself into the rest of the body, he hastens to restrain it. And there"]]},"27":{"l":[[42004027,12.7,"c",["G3497","G3015"]],[40028003,6.4,"c",["G5510"]],[41009003,6.4,"c",["G5510"]],[66001014,6.4,"c",["G5510"]],[40008003,5.9,"c",["G3014"]],[41001042,5.9,"c",["G3014"]],[42005012,5.9,"c",["G3014"]],[42005013,5.9,"c",["G3014"]],[2004006,13.6,"s",["H7950","H6879"]],[4012010,13.6,"s",["H7950","H6879"]],[3014003,13.2,"s",["H6883","H6879"]],[23055010,12.3,"s",["H7950","H2233"]],[3022004,11.4,"s